<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=707" title="View the profile of Corolinth">Corolinth</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 42<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/gohper.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=707"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10184#msg10184"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10184#msg10184">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> August 18, 2004, 09:59:13 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;ll bite because this thread needs more drama. I mean c&#039;mon... his name is &quot;drama please&quot;.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10150#msg10150">Quote from: DramaPrz on August 17, 2004, 01:31:50 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Daarksun<br />Guild Leader<br />65 Dark Elf Shadowknight<br /><br />It&#039;s just the beginning. Some of you now realize what we are capable of doing, if you didn&#039;t already. Xegony dying was expected, not surprising. Coirnav? He&#039;s going to die first attempt. That&#039;s pretty much unheard of and you&#039;ll get laughed at if you try and tell someone as much, but mark my words - it&#039;s gonna happen. Rathe? Well.. I won&#039;t be so ballsy as to guarantee a first attempt win, but it is VERY possible. At the most, it will take a couple of attempts to get our execution down just right. <br /><br />Then on to Time. We&#039;re going to just march right through all of it, wait and see. Nothing will present a major hurdle to us and I expect most if not all of the gods to die on our first attempt. Until Quarm anyway. And we will not have the issues with him that guilds before us have had, i.e. Conviction. Why? Because we have way better gear. We have better players. Simply, Hegemony &gt; Conviction.</div><br />I should hope they&#039;re going to march right through it. The strats for every encounter up to Quarm has got to be posted on the safehouse by now. If you&#039;ve got a walkthrough for PoTime, you can get to phase 4 in about a week. There might be some stumbling with Vallon Zek and Innoruuk, though.<br /><br />Done making drama.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: August 18, 2004, 10:00:49 am by Corolinth</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />&lt;Echoes in Eternity&gt;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10189"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=391" title="View the profile of Karshak">Karshak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 6<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=391"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10189#msg10189"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10189#msg10189">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> August 18, 2004, 11:03:38 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I would think it would be more dramatic if Daarksun wrote a post saying that Hegemony was not as good as other guilds. I mean, isn&#039;t the guild leader supposed to think the guild is better than other guilds in some way? <br /><br />I presume this poster is the same person who posted the other post from our boards a few weeks/months ago. What is surprising to me above all else is that the poster is able to use a mouse to do this kind of thing. One would assume that the absence of a spine would mean that the arms/hands/fingers would not function properly.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: August 18, 2004, 05:01:29 pm by Karshak</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10190"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
