	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10200"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=473" title="View the profile of Laylina">Laylina</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 15<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=473"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10200#msg10200"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10200#msg10200">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> August 18, 2004, 01:46:54 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Honestly I dont even think Hegemony comes up in any of our conversations.&nbsp; We actually frown upon talking about other guilds in guildchat or on open vent.&nbsp; I think last night someone said that it took 120 members/apps to fail to Coirnav.&nbsp; And they were like, we care why? Thats about it.&nbsp; I doubt anyone really cares if you make it to Time or not, FoT clears in one day, ours is 2, and that leaves 4 days for RoS and whoever.&nbsp; There is kind of an assumed/respected pecking order in there.&nbsp; Just like if Ascent came back and decided one day to raid Time, well the people below them just step aside.&nbsp; <br /><br />As for our apps, we keep the ones that are good players and fit into the atmosphere, simple as that.&nbsp; We dont want undesired baggage.&nbsp; It sux enough having people sit out of raids because you have more than 72.&nbsp; I wasnt in the guild before they were Time flagged, so dont know anything about there previous apps.&nbsp; I would imagine though if what Daarks says is true, hell at least those players got Time flagged and made it that much easier for them to get into a top end guild, so not sure what they sweating about.&nbsp; Its all about the mesh of the guild, some people fit, some people dont.&nbsp; Thats with any guild really.<br /><br />As for stealing members, you can only recruit the members that want to leave.&nbsp; And I would imagine you have more to worry about losing members to Ascent &amp; FoT then us.&nbsp; Not too many people just move up one level or laterally.&nbsp; <br /><br />But good try at drama, I would imagine you caused more within your own guild than you did anywhere else.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
