	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10204"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285" title="View the profile of Serepi">Serepi</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 66<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://cfusionpm.com/misc/pulltoopen.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								It&#039;s all about the tail, baby!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10204#msg10204"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10204#msg10204">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #19 on:</b> August 18, 2004, 03:42:55 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Neat.&nbsp; It&#039;s good to know that the more things change, the more they stay the same.&nbsp; Having been retired from EQ for a while now, it&#039;s comforting that the situations never change - just the scenery and the actors.<br /><br />I was trying to decide which attempt at a flame and drama was more pathetic and worthless, DramaPrz&#039;s or Kriyn&#039;s.&nbsp; I&#039;m going to go with DramaPrz on this one.&nbsp; Although it was somewhat of a horse race.&nbsp; Plus, it looks like Kriyn has now deleted his post.&nbsp; Alas.&nbsp; I guess that just leaves Drama.<br /><br />No reason to defend D&#039;s post.&nbsp; It speaks for itself.<br /><br />But I will say this.&nbsp; In my opinion, I can&#039;t think of anyone better to lead a guild than D.&nbsp; Hegemony was, and is, astoundingly lucky to have &quot;The Sir&quot; at the helm.&nbsp; And if you think you can incite drama by posting one of his &quot;Go team!&quot; posts, then you, DramaPrz, are just an idiot.&nbsp; Of course, that&#039;s pretty much the board concensus, so I guess it just goes without saying.<br /><br />(IP addresses are truly wonderful things...)<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Serepi Serein<br />Officer, Hegemony Guild<br />&quot;Delenda est Carthago&quot;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
