							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10200#msg10200">Quote from: Laylina on August 18, 2004, 01:46:54 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><br /><br />As for our apps, we keep the ones that are good players and fit into the atmosphere, simple as that.  We dont want undesired baggage.  </div><br />hmmm...consindering who that is coming from it makes me laugh... <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />
