	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10206"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=473" title="View the profile of Laylina">Laylina</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 15<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=473"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10206#msg10206"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10206#msg10206">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #21 on:</b> August 18, 2004, 04:07:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Whatever Lee  /sigh.  Lots of things have changed between back then and now, but I guess you&#039;ll never change.  Always trying to put me down.  Oh well have fun doing it; Im sure you&#039;ll get a big laugh at it and so will some others.  As for me being baggage, I may have caused some drama JUST AS YOU DID in Forsaken, but I dont believe I was ever baggage.  I had over 85% raid percentage and never shirked from any of my duties and was always on to help people.  Forsaken was just a very stressful guild and Im glad to not have to deal with that stuff anymore.  I may not be an Eaglesky or Stargazeron, but never claimed to be, but I can play my ranger up to and beyond the ability that is required.<br /><br />Not sure why this was turned into a bash Laylina post, I didnt say anything bad in my response.  I respect Hegemony; I have some friends there.  I was just trying to ease their minds about us doing anything underhanded like trying to keep them out of time.  Hell the more people in Time will make us push harder to get out of it.<br /><br />Thanks Lee for always making my day   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/dissappointed.gif" alt="dissappointed" border="0" />  
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
