						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10212"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=34" title="View the profile of Dissonant">Dissonant</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 51<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://webpages.charter.net/awonser/castin.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=gimp3331&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="gimp3331" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=34"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictionguild.com" title="Conviction" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10212#msg10212"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10212#msg10212">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #22 on:</b> August 18, 2004, 09:14:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I have one thing to say...<br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br /><br />As far as the leadership of Conv is concerned, I couldn&#039;t give 2 shits what you and your guild do, Daarksun.  I have a few friends in Heg, and I really wish you guys the best.  Never ONCE have we even DISCUSSED cock-blocking your way to Time.  Hell, (this is no secret, but there&#039;s definitely some bad blood between us and RoS) we never once talked about cock-blocking them.  Never ONCE have we even spoke about you negatively in our guild chat or our forums.  If a member even tries to do so, they typically recieve a prompt smack down by quite a few people.<br /><br />I got a tell a few days from a friend in Heg and they were asking about a rumor concerning us stealing apps from you by offering dkp bonuses etc....  I&#039;m really not sure where your people are getting info like this, but it simply is not true.  I have NEVER told my members to poach people from other guilds, in fact I frown upon it.  Yes, cleric and bard apps will receive a dkp bonus if they are time flagged, but what does that have to do with you guys?<br /><br />This kind of thing really shows me how much of a man you are.  A decent, honorable person would send me a tell and speak to me about these type of things rather than trying to drum up unfounded ridiculous bullshit on a public forum.  I&#039;ve always had respect for your guild and what you&#039;ve accomplished, but I guess that reciprocity is too much to ask.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Elder Dissonant Stormseeker<br />1750 Club<br />Leader of Conviction
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
