								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1026.msg10215#msg10215">Re: Not much but maybe good for a spark.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> August 18, 2004, 09:20:20 pm &#187;</span></td>
