								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Actually, not to be nitpicky Dis, I think someone in their guild posted private guild stuff that Daark had posted on the boards to start sh*t. Don&#039;t think it was Daarksun who posted the original post.<br /><br />Might I suggest Heg, you go through your members section to see who might have access that should not? Just a friendly suggestion hehe.
